SUMMARY:Artist Workshop: Adebunmi Gbadebo
DESCRIPTION:The artist shares her techniques for turning soil into functi
 onal objects. In this hands-on workshop led by artist Adebunmi Gbadebo\,
  learn how to transform the earth beneath your feet into a material full
  of creative potential. Gbadebo\, whose work is on view in the exhibitio
 n "Clay Has Memory: Creative Lineages from Africa\," will share her proc
 ess of creating artworks out of soil she collects. Participants will the
 n have the opportunity to explore the early stages of making ceramics an
 d form small pinch pots to take home\, along with raw clay to continue e
 xploring the material on their own. $50\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/event
 s/2026/artist-workshop-adebunmi-gbadebo
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/artist-workshop-adebunmi-gbadeb
 o
