SUMMARY:Actor Alec Baldwin: In Conversation On Music (Princeton Universit
 y Concerts)
DESCRIPTION:Alec Baldwin’s life has been lived very publicly\, from acc
 laimed roles on stage and screen to personal experiences often shared in
  the media. Amid it all\, classical music has remained a constant refuge
 —a space for reflection\, renewal\, and quiet clarity. “I’m often 
 disappointed when at the movies\,” he admits. “I’m sometimes disap
 pointed when I go to the theater—and I’m never disappointed when I g
 o to the Symphony.” As host of The New York Philharmonic This Week and
  a collaborator with the Pittsburgh Symphony Orchestra\, Baldwin has sha
 red this passion with audiences nationwide\, while also explor\nhttps://
 www.princeton.edu/events/2026/actor-alec-baldwin-conversation-music-prin
 ceton-university-concerts
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/actor-alec-baldwin-conversation
 -music-princeton-university-concerts
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
