UID:4bd12899df7269d4207d040730ddb3cd
DTSTAMP:20260919T025754Z
DTSTART:20260921T220000Z
DTEND:20260921T230000Z
SUMMARY:Kenya’s Future: Democracy\, Leadership\, and the Next Generatio
 n: A Conversation with David Maraga
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a conversation with David Maraga\, former Chief J
 ustice and President of the Supreme Court of Kenya and a candidate in Ke
 nya’s 2027 presidential election. Hear directly from one of Kenya’s 
 most prominent political and judicial figures as he discusses the future
  of Kenya\, democracy\, leadership\, judicial independence\, elections\,
  accountability\, and youth participation. The conversation will be foll
 owed by an open student Q&A\, giving Princeton students the opportunity 
 to engage directly with Maraga and ask their own questions about Kenya
 ’s institutions\, challenges\, and future. Moderate\nhttps://www.princ
 eton.edu/events/2026/kenyas-future-democracy-leadership-and-next-generat
 ion-conversation-david-maraga
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/kenyas-future-democracy-leaders
 hip-and-next-generation-conversation-david-maraga
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
