SUMMARY:Tour of Marquand Library
DESCRIPTION:Marquand Library\, founded in 1908\, is one of the finest art
  libraries in North America. Marquand re-opened within the new Art Museu
 m complex after an almost five-year hiatus in January 2026. Tours of the
  five-floor non-circulating library will be led by Rebecca Friedman\, Ar
 t Librarian for Research Services\, who has worked at Marquand since 200
