SUMMARY:Seuls en Scène 2026 presents Losing Your Bag by Pascal Rambert
DESCRIPTION:Postponed to 2027. This work-in-progress one-woman piece is a
  collaboration between renowned French playwright Pascal Rambert and act
 ress Pauline Chalamet. The play follows a young woman with a master’s 
 degree who is—temporarily—a window cleaner. Over the course of the p
 erformance\, she expresses her anger at social stratification and grappl
 es with loneliness in a world divided between “people who succeed and 
 people who are nothing.” Losing Your Bag comes to Princeton before mak
 ing its English-language premiere at L’Alliance New York’s Crossing 
 the Line Festival in November. Rambert\, who was a \nhttps://www.princet
 on.edu/events/2026/seuls-en-scene-2026-presents-losing-your-bag-pascal-r
 ambert
