SUMMARY:Getting Published with IEEE
DESCRIPTION:In this customized author workshop\, you will learn how to ge
 t published with the IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engin
 eers) to increase your research's visibility and credibility. We will sh
 are tips on organizing and structuring a high-quality paper\, selecting 
 an appropriate IEEE periodical or conference\, getting assistance from t
 he IEEE Author Center\, submitting your manuscript\, and using IEEE Xplo
 re effectively to start your literature review. This workshop will help 
 you navigate IEEE’s peer review and submission processes and discuss t
 he top reasons papers get rejected. This s\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/ev
 ents/2026/getting-published-ieee-0
