 a way to help you view and curate digital collections of high-resolution
  images more effectively and creatively. Yichin Chen\, Curator of Asian 
 Collections and Digital Specialist at Visual Resources\, Department of A
 rt & Archaeology\, will introduce what IIIF is\, how it can be used in c
 ourses\, and what role AI can play in its integration. She will also sha
 re her experience at the 2026 IIIF Annual Conference.\nhttps://www.princ
