SUMMARY:Glee Club Presents: Christ Church (Oxford) Cathedral Choir
DESCRIPTION:As part of this year’s ‘Glee Club Presents’ series\, Th
 e Christ Church Cathedral Choir celebrates its 500th anniversary and per
 forms in collaboration with the students of the Glee Club.This program s
 howcases the rich musical legacy of a unique foundation — one that is 
 both Oxford’s cathedral and a college of the University of Oxford. The
  program traces that history from John Taverner\, appointed by Cardinal 
